# Requirement node schema
# One row per requirement in the consuming project
id,title,description,priority,status,source
# id: Unique identifier (e.g., REQ-001). Convention: prefix-number.
# title: Short human-readable name
# description: Full requirement text (SHALL/SHOULD language)
# priority: critical|high|medium|low
# status: draft|approved|implemented|verified|deprecated
# source: Origin of this requirement (person, document, date)
